<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mo 22.70 pct, 3-mo 22.40.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR rates down, 1-mo 22.70 pct, 3-mo 22.40.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased for both the one-month and the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 22.70 percent, down 0.01 while the three-month rate at 22.40 percent, down 0.06 percent, the NBH said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
